Abstract = {The research presented in this paper concerns the diversity and spatial
   structure of town green areas. Its goal was to compare the dendroflora
   of the ``Wschod{''} estate in Swidnik with similar urban architectural
   complexes that have been analysed thus far. The purpose of this research
   was also to compile an inventory and to determine the species diversity
   of trees and shrubs that grow within the estate, as well as to indicate
   their composition and spatial function.},
